{"articleNo":"201744","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=201744&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대구통학버스] 2018-2학기 및 동계방학 예약 관련 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.12.14","hit":"5486","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2018-2학기 대구통학버스는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;<strong>2018.12.21.(금)<u>까지</u> 운행되므로</strong>,</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">반드시 <strong><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000\">21일(금)까지만</span> </span></strong>예약바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">동계방학(계절학기 포함) 대구통학버스는 <strong>2018.12.24.(월)<u>부터</u> 운행되며</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">예약은 <span style=\"COLOR: #1b2093\"><strong>2018.12.18.(화)부터 </strong></span>가능합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">​궁금한 사항이 있으시면 학생처(478-7040)으로 연락주세요</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
